```

The most important mental model is:

```text
WHERE
 ↓
Which rows do I want?
```

And:

```text
AND → All conditions
OR  → At least one condition
IN  → Match a list
BETWEEN → Match a range
LIKE → Match a pattern
IS NULL → Find missing values
